# Nutrition safety (ADR-0001)

- Layer 1: physiology → targets in `packages/core`.
- Layer 2: deterministic solver over the food catalog. Seeded, reproducible.
- Layer 3 (`packages/ai`): meal names and prep notes only. Schema + numeric-claim + groundedness guardrails. Fail closed to `fallbackNarrative`.
- Plans stay DRAFT until explicit coach publish. Never auto-publish on generate.
- Do not send PII to the model. `assertDeidentified` is required at the Layer-3 boundary.
